### ParkSync Payment Integration Test File
### Make sure to set your JWT token and Razorpay credentials

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@token = your_jwt_token_here

### 1. Create Payment Order
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/create
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 150.50,
  "currency": "INR",
  "customerName": "John Doe",
  "customerEmail": "john.doe@example.com",
  "customerPhone": "+919876543210",
  "notes": {
    "parkingSessionId": "session-uuid-here",
    "slotNumber": "A-001",
    "vehicleNumber": "KA01AB1234"
  }
}

### 2. Verify Payment (After successful Razorpay payment)
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "razorpayOrderId": "order_1234567890",
  "razorpayPaymentId": "pay_1234567890",
  "razorpaySignature": "signature_1234567890"
}

### 3. Get Payment by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/payments/payment-uuid-here
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Get Payment by Transaction ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/payments/transaction/order_1234567890
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Get All Payments (with pagination)
GET {{baseUrl}}/payments?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Get Payments by Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/payments/status/SUCCESS
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Get Payment Statistics
GET {{baseUrl}}/payments/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. Refund Payment
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/refund
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "paymentId": "payment-uuid-here",
  "amount": 100.50,
  "reason": "Customer requested partial refund"
}

### 9. Razorpay Webhook (for testing)
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/webhook
Content-Type: application/json
X-Razorpay-Signature: your_webhook_signature_here

{
  "event": "payment.captured",
  "payload": {
    "payment": {
      "entity": {
        "id": "pay_1234567890",
        "amount": 15050,
        "currency": "INR",
        "status": "captured",
        "order_id": "order_1234567890",
        "method": "card",
        "description": "Parking Payment",
        "created_at": 1640995200
      }
    }
  }
}

### 10. Test Payment Creation with Different Amounts
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/create
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 75.00,
  "currency": "INR",
  "customerName": "Jane Smith",
  "customerEmail": "jane.smith@example.com",
  "customerPhone": "+919876543211",
  "notes": {
    "parkingSessionId": "session-uuid-2",
    "slotNumber": "B-002",
    "vehicleNumber": "KA02CD5678",
    "duration": "2 hours"
  }
}

### 11. Test Payment Creation for Different Vehicle Types
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/create
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 25.00,
  "currency": "INR",
  "customerName": "Mike Johnson",
  "customerEmail": "mike.johnson@example.com",
  "customerPhone": "+919876543212",
  "notes": {
    "parkingSessionId": "session-uuid-3",
    "slotNumber": "M-001",
    "vehicleNumber": "KA03EF9012",
    "vehicleType": "TWO_WHEELER",
    "duration": "1 hour"
  }
}
